  "as_of": "2013-05-15",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would increase the Medicare levy income thresholds for families, including the additional allowance for each dependent child or student, in line with inflation.",
   "It would lift the base family threshold from $32,743 to $33,693 and the amount for each dependent child or student from $3,007 to $3,094.",
   "The changes would apply to tax assessments for 2012-13 and subsequent income years, covering the family threshold and its dependent child-student component."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The family exemption threshold would increase to $33,693.",
   "Each dependent child or student would add $3,094 to the family threshold.",
   "The revised amounts would apply to assessments from the 2012-13 income year."
  ],
  "affected": "Families with low incomes, including taxpayers with dependent children or students, are affected.",
