   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "Explained the Tax Laws Amendment (Medicare Levy) Bill 2013 raises the family low-income Medicare levy threshold from $32,743 to $33,693 and the per-child amount from $3,007 to $3,094, applying from the 2012-13 income year, and welcomed visiting students from Penrith Christian School."
  }
